  "<div class=\"ej-block\">\n    <div class=\"ej-enunciado\"><span class=\"num\">1.</span> <strong>Une</strong> cada objeto con la figura que tiene su <strong>forma</strong>:</div>\n    <div class=\"objetos-grid\">\n      <div class=\"objetos-col\">\n        <div class=\"objeto-caja\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><polygon points=\"30,8 54,50 6,50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"44\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">!</text></svg>\n          <span class=\"objeto-nombre\">señal</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"objeto-caja\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg>\n          <span class=\"objeto-nombre\">ventana</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"objeto-caja\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"6\" width=\"28\" height=\"48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"38\" cy=\"32\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#000\"/></svg>\n          <span class=\"objeto-nombre\">puerta</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"objeto-caja\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"16\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"34\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg>\n          <span class=\"objeto-nombre\">reloj</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"objeto-caja\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><polygon points=\"30,6 50.8,18 50.8,42 30,54 9.2,42 9.2,18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg>\n          <span class=\"objeto-nombre\">tuerca</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"objetos-col\">\n        <div class=\"objetos-nom\">cuadrado</div>\n        <div class=\"objetos-nom\">hexágono</div>\n        <div class=\"objetos-nom\">triángulo</div>\n        <div class=\"objetos-nom\">rectángulo</div>\n        <div class=\"objetos-nom\">círculo</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>",
  "<div class=\"ej-block\">\n    <div class=\"ej-enunciado\"><span class=\"num\">2.</span> Observa el <strong>robot</strong> y cuenta cuántas figuras hay de cada tipo:</div>\n    <div class=\"robot-grid\">\n      <div class=\"robot-caja\">\n        <svg width=\"200\" height=\"210\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 210\">\n          <!-- antena -->\n          <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"28\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <!-- cabeza hexágono -->\n          <polygon points=\"100,28 120.8,40 120.8,64 100,76 79.2,64 79.2,40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          <!-- ojos -->\n          <circle cx=\"91\" cy=\"48\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"109\" cy=\"48\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <!-- boca -->\n          <rect x=\"90\" y=\"59\" width=\"20\" height=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <!-- cuerpo cuadrado -->\n          <rect x=\"70\" y=\"76\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n          <!-- botón pentágono -->\n          <polygon points=\"100,94 111.4,102.3 107.1,115.7 92.9,115.7 88.6,102.3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          <!-- brazos -->\n          <rect x=\"38\" y=\"80\" width=\"32\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <rect x=\"130\" y=\"80\" width=\"32\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <!-- manos -->\n          <circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"86\" r=\"8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"86\" r=\"8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <!-- piernas -->\n          <rect x=\"78\" y=\"136\" width=\"14\" height=\"40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <rect x=\"108\" y=\"136\" width=\"14\" height=\"40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <!-- pies triángulos -->\n          <polygon points=\"60,196 96,196 85,176\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          <polygon points=\"104,196 140,196 115,176\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"conteo-lista\">\n        <div class=\"conteo-item\"><svg class=\"conteo-fig\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><polygon points=\"30,8 52,52 8,52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg> triángulos: <span class=\"conteo-hueco\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"conteo-item\"><svg class=\"conteo-fig\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"3\"/></svg> cuadrados: <span class=\"conteo-hueco\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"conteo-item\"><svg class=\"conteo-fig\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"16\" width=\"48\" height=\"28\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"3\"/></svg> rectángulos: <span class=\"conteo-hueco\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"conteo-item\"><svg class=\"conteo-fig\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"3\"/></svg> círculos: <span class=\"conteo-hueco\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"conteo-item\"><svg class=\"conteo-fig\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><polygon points=\"30,6 52.8,22.6 44.1,49.4 15.9,49.4 7.2,22.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg> pentágonos: <span class=\"conteo-hueco\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"conteo-item\"><svg class=\"conteo-fig\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><polygon points=\"30,6 50.8,18 50.8,42 30,54 9.2,42 9.2,18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg> hexágonos: <span class=\"conteo-hueco\"></span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>",
  "<div class=\"ej-block\">\n    <div class=\"ej-enunciado\"><span class=\"num\">3.</span> <strong>Rodea el intruso</strong> de cada fila (la figura que no es como las demás):</div>\n    <div class=\"intruso-fila\">\n      <div class=\"intruso-fig\"><svg class=\"figura-mini\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><polygon points=\"30,6 52.8,22.6 44.1,49.4 15.9,49.4 7.2,22.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></div>\n      <div class=\"intruso-fig\"><svg class=\"figura-mini\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><polygon points=\"30,6 52.8,22.6 44.1,49.4 15.9,49.4 7.2,22.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" transform=\"rotate(36 30 30)\"/></svg></div>\n      <div class=\"intruso-fig\"><svg class=\"figura-mini\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><polygon points=\"30,6 50.8,18 50.8,42 30,54 9.2,42 9.2,18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></div>\n      <div class=\"intruso-fig\"><svg class=\"figura-mini\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><polygon points=\"30,6 52.8,22.6 44.1,49.4 15.9,49.4 7.2,22.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" transform=\"rotate(72 30 30)\"/></svg></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"intruso-fila\">\n      <div class=\"intruso-fig\"><svg class=\"figura-mini\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><polygon points=\"30,8 52,52 8,52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></div>\n      <div class=\"intruso-fig\"><svg class=\"figura-mini\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><polygon points=\"30,8 52,52 8,52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" transform=\"rotate(180 30 30)\"/></svg></div>\n      <div class=\"intruso-fig\"><svg class=\"figura-mini\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/></svg></div>\n      <div class=\"intruso-fig\"><svg class=\"figura-mini\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><polygon points=\"30,8 52,52 8,52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" transform=\"rotate(90 30 30)\"/></svg></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"intruso-fila\" style=\"margin-bottom:0;\">\n      <div class=\"intruso-fig\"><svg class=\"figura-mini\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/></svg></div>\n      <div class=\"intruso-fig\"><svg class=\"figura-mini\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"19\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/></svg></div>\n      <div class=\"intruso-fig\"><svg class=\"figura-mini\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/></svg></div>\n      <div class=\"intruso-fig\"><svg class=\"figura-mini\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><polygon points=\"30,6 52.8,22.6 44.1,49.4 15.9,49.4 7.2,22.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>",
  "<div class=\"ej-block\">\n    <div class=\"ej-enunciado\"><span class=\"num\">4.</span> <strong>Continúa la serie</strong> dibujando las dos figuras que faltan:</div>\n    <div class=\"serie-fila\">\n      <div class=\"serie-celda\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/></svg></div>\n      <div class=\"serie-celda\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><polygon points=\"30,8 52,52 8,52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></div>\n      <div class=\"serie-celda\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/></svg></div>\n      <div class=\"serie-celda\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><polygon points=\"30,8 52,52 8,52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></div>\n      <div class=\"serie-celda\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/></svg></div>\n      <div class=\"serie-celda vacia\"></div>\n      <div class=\"serie-celda vacia\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"serie-fila\" style=\"margin-bottom:0;\">\n      <div class=\"serie-celda\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><polygon points=\"30,6 52.8,22.6 44.1,49.4 15.9,49.4 7.2,22.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></div>\n      <div class=\"serie-celda\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/></svg></div>\n      <div class=\"serie-celda\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><polygon points=\"30,6 52.8,22.6 44.1,49.4 15.9,49.4 7.2,22.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></div>\n      <div class=\"serie-celda\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" str